@host = http://localhost:5051
@readerToken = local-reader-token-0000000000
@ingestToken = local-ingest-token-0000000000

### Health — no token required; a container probe has none.
GET {{host}}/health

### Reconciliation as JSON — needs the `reader` role.
GET {{host}}/api/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Same figures as Markdown — this is the checked-in deliverable's source.
GET {{host}}/api/reconciliation/report.md
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Exceptions, with the rows_in = matched + exceptions identity.
GET {{host}}/api/exceptions
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Filter exceptions by reason code or claim.
GET {{host}}/api/exceptions?reason=AMBIGUOUS_DATE
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### One claim, its lines, and its full remittance history.
GET {{host}}/api/claims/GPP-2026-000101
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Audit trail — last 500 entries.
GET {{host}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Re-ingest. Requires the `ingest` role; a `reader` token gets 403.
### Returns unchanged=true when the pack has not moved.
POST {{host}}/api/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{ingestToken}}

### Expect 401 — no token.
GET {{host}}/api/reconciliation

### Expect 403 — valid token, wrong role.
POST {{host}}/api/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
